  "solution": "Given:\n\nx2 + y2 = 427 \n\nxy = 202 \n\nFormula used:\n\n(a + b)² = (a² + 2ab + b2)\n\n(a + b)² - 4ab = (a - b)²\n\nCalculation:\n\n(x + y)2 = (427 + 2 × 202)\n\n(x + y)2 = (427 + 404)\n\n(x + y) = √831\n\n(x - y)2 = (427 - 2 × 202)\n\n(x - y)2 = (427 - 2 × 202)\n\n(x - y) = √23\n\nx+y/x-y = √831/√23\n\n**The answer is √(831/23)**",
